    {
      "id": "p1",
      "text": "The chief executive announced a directive to reshape the workforce for new creation, a strategic initiative for product acceleration aimed at forging AI-driven products. This corporate decision communicated to staff will result in a massive human cost, a painful upheaval for personnel impacted by corporate restructuring. The restructuring will involve job elimination across the organization.",
