    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "Closing legacy workshops to consolidate creative hubs, the tax-software company is abandoning physical spaces of making as offices cease operations. This organizational change moves workers displaced by strategic shifts, offering a structured severance package for displaced creators as a transition fund. The office closure in locations like Reno is a real estate disposal part of this business strategy.",
